			"Message": "style(Worker): Remove blank lines after opening braces and normalize README\n\nReverse the blank-line-after-opening-brace convention from commit\ne53b87c across all TypeScript modules — remove extra blank lines\nthat were inserted after `{` in arrow-function bodies, interface\nmembers, `declare global` blocks, conditional branches, and the\ntelemetry lazy-import block.\n\nAffected modules: Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.ts, Telemetry/Bridge.ts,\nWorker.ts, CSS/Load.ts, Policy.ts, Register.ts.\n\nAlso normalize README.md prose line-wrapping to a consistent column\nwidth and align markdown table column headers/dashes with the\nproject's formatting conventions.\n\nNo runtime behaviour changes.",
