			],
			"Message": "style(Worker): Normalize blank-line spacing across all modules\n\nInsert a blank line immediately after the opening brace of all arrow-function bodies, interface members, `declare global` blocks, and conditional branches across Configuration, Telemetry, CSS/Load, Policy, Register, and the root Worker entry point.\n\nThis is a purely cosmetic formatting pass that eliminates inconsistent whitespace (some blocks had the opening brace followed immediately by code; others did not), bringing every function body into a uniform `{` + blank line + code rhythm.\n\nNo runtime behaviour changes.",
