			"Message": "chore(Worker): Advance stored message in commit-msg.json\n\nUpdate the commit-msg.json tracking file, replacing the previously\nstored message (placed by commit 556f770) with the current commit's\nmessage.\n\nThis keeps the machine-readable commit log in sync after each commit,\nensuring downstream tooling and audit pipelines always reference the\ncurrent commit message without git log parsing.",
